{"id":"marchandise","lemma":"marchandise","pos":"noun","rank":3164,"glosses":["merchandise"],"ipa":"/maʁ.ʃɑ̃.diz/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Fr-marchandise.ogg/Fr-marchandise.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"marchandises"},"formAudio":{"marchandises":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-marchandises.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Aucune marchandise ne peut être retournée.","en":"No merchandise can be returned.","words":[{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Nous voulons seulement vous vendre des marchandises.","en":"We just want to sell you things.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to sell"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Les marchandises sont arrivées hier.","en":"The goods arrived yesterday.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"arrival","l":"arrivée"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Ne touche pas à la marchandise, je te prie.","en":"Please don't touch the merchandise.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to touch","l":"toucher"},{"g":"not"},null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to pray","l":"prier"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"Leurs marchandises sont de la plus haute qualité.","en":"Their goods are of the highest quality.","words":[{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"high society"},{"g":"quality"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]}]}